  "ruleText": "Med 412.01 Procedure for Surrendering A License. License surrender may be requested by a licensee at any time by filing a petition or motion with the board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Med 500) #8945, eff 7-18-07, EXPIRED: 7-18-15\n\nNew. #10925, INTERIM, eff 9-4-15, EXPIRES: 3-2-16; ss by #11048, eff 3-2-16",
